/fn><fn id="t3fn7"><label>&#x02016;</label><p>Cell entries are standardized &#x003b2; coefficients (<italic>P</italic> value) of adjusted association between medication beliefs and the medical outcome variable.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>